Z||000006||KissMySSFiero||12-12-2001||12:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Nice car SS.. Is the Red one going to be your engine swap car? Did you ever sell the Fastback stuff?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I did sell the fastback stuff.  the yellow one will be the engine swap car if it doesnt cost too much to get the body damage fixed.  if it is too much then i will most likely part the yellow car and find an aero notchback and do a swap with that.  the red car will be cleaned up,  i want to do a 3.4 swap and 4spd auto conversion.  maybe paint it a very dark purple, almost black. <BR>i really want to keep the yellow formula for a v8 conversion but i cant see paying 1500 to get come body work done.  but will see.  she goes in for an estimate next month.  maybe sooner.  please pray for my poor car.  <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <BR>Two 88FORMULAS Red & Yellow<BR>        <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>         <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
