Z||000008||2xsess||12-12-2001||03:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by turbo86se:<BR><B>Looks great JoeJoe!!! How does it run? I don't recognize the yellow Formula, is that a spoiler on there?     <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/biggrin2.gif">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/group_in_FL.jpg">  <BR>Just having fun posting pics now that I've figured it out!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>First congrats on the new Formula. and Congrats to Joel for figuring out how to post pics.lol<BR>I was thinking the same thing about the "spoiler-less Formula". Hey..that's my car next to it! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hope you have good luck with it JoeJoe.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">           <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
